# Audit exceptions — frontend
#
# Read by scripts/ci/npm-audit-gate.mjs (CI job "npm audit — frontend").
# The gate fails on any high/critical advisory that is not listed here.
#
# Format — one exception per line:
#   <ADVISORY-ID>: <reason> <tracking issue URL> [expires YYYY-MM-DD]
#
# ADVISORY-ID is the GHSA id from the advisory URL (preferred) or NPM-<id>.
# A GitHub issue link is REQUIRED; entries without one, duplicates, and
# expired entries fail the gate. See docs/BRANCH_PROTECTION.md.
#
# Example:
#   GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx: Only reachable from the build toolchain https://github.com/MyFanss/MyFans/issues/1234 expires 2026-12-31

# Currently no exceptions — all high/critical advisories must be fixed before merge.
